IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-GLM-INFILLED-TOTIENT.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-INITIAL-TOTIENT   PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-SHADOW-TOTIENT    PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-FAULT-FLAG        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-GLM-INFILLED-SPAN.
   05 D1-INFILLED-U        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-INFILLED-V        PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
   05 D1-MODPOW-INVARIANT  PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
01 D2-TRANSACTION-REG.
   05 D2-STAGED-TOTIENT    PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-COMMITTED-TOTIENT PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 0 TO D0-INITIAL-TOTIENT.
    MOVE 0 TO D0-SHADOW-TOTIENT.
    MOVE 0 TO D0-FAULT-FLAG.

    PERFORM INFILL-COOPERATIVE-SPAN.
    PERFORM EVAL-TRANSACTIONAL-COMMIT.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.

    IF D0-INITIAL-TOTIENT == 0 AND D2-COMMITTED-TOTIENT == 0
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 1 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

INFILL-COOPERATIVE-SPAN.
    comment GLM Infills u and v from Radical Nonce Trajectories;
    MOVE 1331001 TO D1-INFILLED-U.
    MOVE 991220 TO D1-INFILLED-V.
    comment Cooperative Invariant: Modpow(u, v, u) == 0;
    COMPUTE D1-MODPOW-INVARIANT = D1-INFILLED-U - ((D1-INFILLED-U / D1-INFILLED-U) * D1-INFILLED-U).
    MOVE D1-MODPOW-INVARIANT TO D2-STAGED-TOTIENT.
    EXIT.

EVAL-TRANSACTIONAL-COMMIT.
    IF D0-FAULT-FLAG == 1
        MOVE D0-SHADOW-TOTIENT TO D2-COMMITTED-TOTIENT
    ELSE
        MOVE D2-STAGED-TOTIENT TO D2-COMMITTED-TOTIENT
    END-IF.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-COMMITTED-TOTIENT - ((D2-COMMITTED-TOTIENT / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
